---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About us">
  <div class="page-content">
    <h1>About Savoir French</h1>

    <div class="side-by-side">
      <figure>
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554475659-9fd915c8f156?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60"
          alt="Placeholder stock photo of a French baguette — not an actual photo of Savoir French"
          width="1200"
          height="800"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>
          Placeholder photo (Unsplash), not a real photo of this café.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div>
        <p>
          We're Rebecca &amp; Clarisse, co-directors of Savoir French. We
          were both born and raised in France, and professionally trained
          in Australia. Between us, we have 29 years' experience in
          hospitality and a shared passion for the industry — we love
          sharing our culture and language through traditional food and
          personalised service.
        </p>

        <p>
          No request is ever too big. We're dedicated to giving you the
          most authentic experience, so you can indulge in a piece of
          France in Canberra.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="story-feature">
    <h2>Our story</h2>
    <blockquote>
      Good, simple and honest traditional French food, made in-house from
      scratch, using only high quality, fresh and raw ingredients.
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <div class="page-content">
    <h2>What we make</h2>
    <p>
      Savoir French is a play on words. In French, the term
      <em>savoir-faire</em> means "know-how" — reflecting our business:
      skilled workers with French know-how, making traditional bread,
      pastries, dishes and cakes. We're also committed to producing
      minimal waste, and give back to the community by donating leftover
      food.
    </p>

    <h2>Our team</h2>
    <figure>
      <img
        src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0350/0274/4891/files/IMG-20260506-WA0000.jpg?v=1778050459"
        alt="The Savoir French team"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>
    <p>
      Our team, without whom none of this would be possible, is also made
      up of superstar baker Gustavo, fabulous all-rounder Yorick, all-star
      Head Chef Cody, expert Pastry Chef Vu, and not-to-be-underestimated
      kitchen apprentice Jack.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
